# Raw workflow JSONs are personal: they embed prompt text and input filenames
# (which on Midjourney-style exports carry the username and the full prompt).
# Only the sanitised copies under workflows/ are versioned — produce them with
# sanitize-workflow.py, and check-workflows.sh refuses anything unsanitised.
*.json
!workflows/*.json

# inventory.sh output: the extracted tarball plus ~99 of ComfyUI's own bundled
# template workflows, swept up by the loose find. Noise, and not ours to
# redistribute.
extract/
comfyui-extract.tgz

# Full paths from the machine it was inventoried on.
usage.txt
